# Keeps `docker build` context transfer fast. Added for the Antithesis harness
# (antithesis/dca.Dockerfile, antithesis/kube-apiserver.Dockerfile), which are the
# first Dockerfiles in this repo to `COPY . .` the whole source tree as a build
# context — none of these paths are needed to compile any Go binary.
.git/
bin/
.mypy_cache/
/openshift_run.log
/e2e_test_output*.json*
/junit-out-*.xml
